# Optional free-tier API keys (MucNav works out-of-the-box with zero keys via automatic open fallbacks!)

# MapTiler free tier (100k map loads/month) for polished Standard (Streets Light/Dark) & Hybrid Satellite styles.
# If omitted, MucNav automatically falls back to OpenFreeMap vector tiles + Esri World Imagery Hybrid!
# Get a free key at: https://cloud.maptiler.com/
NEXT_PUBLIC_MAPTILER_KEY=

# OpenRouteService free tier (2,000 route requests/day) for Car, Bike, Foot & TSP Stop Optimization.
# If omitted, MucNav automatically falls back to the public FOSSGIS Valhalla instance!
# Get a free key at: https://openrouteservice.org/dev/#/signup
ORS_API_KEY=
